  "Certain page elements report their classes in a format the scripts did not expect. Besides reading them correctly now, a script that hits an unexpected error while waiting for the page gives up instead of retrying forever.": "某些页面元素以脚本所不期望的格式报告其分类。 除了现在正确阅读它们之外, 脚本在等待页面时会触动出乎意料的错误, 而不是永远重试。",
  "Chaining / Chat: browse your faction's past chain reports": "链链/聊天:浏览你派别过去的链链报告",
  "Chaining browser can now be opened in full-screen mode (disabled by default)": "链式浏览器现在可以全屏模式打开(默认禁用)",
  "Chaining: TORN targets can now be imported to the targets list": "链链:TORN目标现在可以输入目标清单",
  "Chaining: live chain from the Torn page you are viewing": "连击:您正在查看的撕破页面上的活连击",
  "Chaining: swipe a target, war or retaliation card to open the profile": "链链:为打开配置文件而刷新目标、战争或报复卡",
  "Chaining: tapping a target in the war or retaliation lists no longer fails to start the attack": "链锁:在战争中锁定目标或报复名单不再无法发动攻击",
  "Chaining: targets can now be sorted by time added": "链链:现在可以按时间添加对目标进行分类",
  "Chat without leaving the game. The chat floats over the browser in a window you can move, resize or shrink to a bubble, and any conversation can pop out on its own.\n\nNames open a player card with their status and quick actions, links open in a preview, and sell and buy offers in Trade and Global show the market value. Each chat has its own alerts, and rooms can alert you only when you are mentioned. With the app closed, only private messages notify you: faction, company and other rooms alert while Torn PDA is open or just left.\n\nEverything else is in Tips > Chat.": "聊天不离开游戏。 聊天在浏览器上浮动, 在窗口中您可以移动、 调整大小或缩到泡泡上, 任何对话都可以自动出现。\n\n名称以其状态和快速动作打开玩家卡,在预览中打开链接,并在贸易和全球公司出售和购买报价时显示市场价值。 每次聊天都有自己的警报 房间只有在提到你的时候才能提醒你 程序关闭后,只有私人信息通知你:派系、公司和其他房间的警报,而Torn PDA是开放的或刚离开。\n\n其他一切都在Tips > 聊天。",
  "Chat: Giphy and Tenor links now show as GIFs": "聊天: Gphy 和 Tenor 链接现在显示为 GIF",
  "Chat: Torn's chat is now built into Torn PDA": "聊天:Trn的聊天现在被建在Torn PDA",
  "Chat: add a chat message to a note": "聊天: 在便笺中添加聊天消息",
  "Chat: added Torn's notepad, with folders, pins, search, sorting, tasks and images": "聊天: 添加了Torn的笔记本, 包括文件夹、 插针、 搜索、 排序、 任务和图像",
  "Chat: added slash (/) commands to open quick actions and the notepad": "聊天: 添加斜线 (/) 命令以打开快速动作和笔记本",
  "Chat: bank requests and paid confirmations accept \"all\" or \"max\"": "聊天:银行申请和已付确认书接受“所有”或“最大”",
  "Chat: bazaars of other players only show open or closed, following Torn API changes": "聊天: 其他玩家的集市仅显示打开或关闭, 在 Trn API 更改后",
  "Chat: change a refused image upload key right from the error": "聊天:从错误中更改拒绝的图像上传密钥右侧",
  "Chat: faction links open a faction card": "聊天:派系联系打开派别卡",
  "Chat: fixed an error with split screens and keyboard": "聊天: 用拆分屏幕和键盘固定错误",
  "Chat: fixed missing icons in the browser when using chat": "聊天:使用聊天时在浏览器中固定丢失的图标",
  "Chat: fixed player cards and bazaar prices": "聊天:固定玩家卡和集市价格",
  "Chat: hit calls can count down until the target is out": "聊天:打中电话可以倒计时,直到目标结束",
  "Chat: place a bounty from the player card": "聊天:从玩家卡中抽取赏金",
  "Chat: play YouTube videos inside the chat": "聊天:在聊天中播放YouTube视频",
  "Chat: read forum threads without leaving the chat": "聊天:阅读论坛线索而不离开聊天",
  "Chat: tap the bubble again to close the chat window": "聊天:再次打开泡沫关闭聊天窗口",
  "Chat: you can now tap the messages to close the keyboard": "聊天: 现在您可以监听信件关闭键盘",
  "Choose the items you want to follow in Alerts, under City Shops. Items whose restock can be predicted warn you a few minutes in advance; the rest notify you as soon as the restock is seen. You can also ask to be notified only once the item is confirmed in stock.": "选择您想要在警报中, 在城市商店下跟随的项目。 可以预告其补给物品提前几分钟警告你;其余物品一看到补给物品,即通知你。 有关物品的库存确认后,您也可要求得到通知。",
  "City shops: fixed count for purchases made close together": "市商店:近似购买的固定账号",
  "Clock now highlights active events and competitions": "时钟现在突出显示活跃的活动和比赛",
  "Crashes in some iOS devices when launching the browser": "启动浏览器时某些 IOS 设备崩溃",
  "Create modes such as \"Casino\" or \"Trader\" from the options menu of the scripts section. While a mode is on, the switches in the list choose which scripts run in it, and scripts marked as always active run in every mode. The war mode shortcuts now let you pick the mode.": "从脚本部分的选项菜单中创建“ Casino” 或“ Trader” 等模式。 当一个模式在运行时, 列表中的开关会选择其中运行的脚本, 而脚本会标记为每个模式中总是活动运行的脚本。 战争模式快捷键现在允许您选择模式。",
  "Dev Tools: added Scripts tab to manage active userscripts for the current page": "Dev 工具: 新增脚本标签, 用于管理当前页面的当前用户脚本",
  "Dev: added 'tab state' webview handler (see details)": "Dev: 添加“ tab state” 网络视图处理器( 详情见)",
  "Dev: new architecture overview docs": "Dev:新架构概览文件",
  "Dev: new architecture overview docs [DarXide]": "Dev:新架构概览文件 [DarXide]",
  "Developer tools: storage entries can be deleted in bulk": "开发者工具: 存储条目可以大量删除",
  "Disabled by default\n\nIf active, you will see all the properties you rent out to other players in the Rented Properties section in the Miscellaneous card. If inactive, you will only see the properties you rent (the ones you pay rent for)\n\nYou can toggle this option via the Profile Page options menu (gear icon in the Profile Page)": "默认禁用\n\n如果活动,您将会看到杂项卡中租赁属性栏中其他玩家的所有租赁属性。 如果非活动,您只能看到您租赁的财产( 您支付房租的) 。\n\n您可以通过配置文件页面选项菜单( 在配置文件页面中显示图标)切换此选项",
  "Disabled by default.\n\nGo to Settings / Advanced Browser Settings and scroll down to the Maintenance section.\n\nWhen enabled, the browser will no longer resize when the keyboard appears, which might have a positive impact on keyboard animation speed (this is highly dependent on the device and keyboard used).\n\nIMPORTANT: the keyboard will overlay the bottom of the page (tab bar).": "默认残疾。\n\n转到设置/高级浏览器设置,滚动到维护部分。\n\n启用时, 当键盘出现时浏览器将不再调整大小, 这可能会对键盘动画速度产生积极影响( 这在很大程度上取决于所使用的设备和键盘) 。\n\n重要:键盘将覆盖页面底部(塔巴)。",
  "Disabled by default: you can enable it in Alerts\n\nNOTE: in order to reduce API load, checks will be performed every 15 minutes, so the notification may not be immediate after a new post is made": "默认禁用: 您可以在警告中启用它\n\n注:为减少API负负负,每15分钟进行一次检查,因此通知不得在新设员额后立即发出。",
  "Disabled by default: you can enable it in Settings / Advanced Browser Settings\n\nIt is HIGHLY recommended that you visit the Tips section to understand how to properly use this feature to its full potential\n\nThe Floating Action Button is a feature that allows you to perform indirect actions on your tabs as well as some direct navigation actions. It has several functions that are important to know to get the most out of it.\n\nThis can have many uses and help in a multitude of situations. It can also prevent involuntarily activating voice commands or assistants when double- or triple-tapping the bottom edge in some devices.": "默认禁用 : 您可以在设置/ 高级浏览器设置中启用它\n\n强烈建议你访问Tips部分,了解如何适当利用这一特征充分发挥其潜力。\n\n浮动动作按钮是一个功能,允许您在标签上执行间接操作以及一些直接导航操作。 它有几项职能,必须知道如何充分利用这些职能。\n\n这在多种情况下可以有许多用途和帮助。 它还可以防止在某些装置中双倍或三倍触动底层边缘时非自愿激活语音指令或助理。",
  "Downloaded files trigger a share request automatically by default (see Tips for more info)": "已下载的文件默认自动触发共享请求( 更多信息请参见 Tips )",
  "Drawer sections can now be reordered, hidden and customized": "现在可以重新排序、隐藏和定制抽取区域",
  "Drug and booster cooldown travel warnings now support a configurable time threshold": "毒品和助推器冷却的旅行警告现在支持了可配置的时间阈值",
  "Elimination messages can now be excluded from chat notifications": "消除信息信息现在可以排除在聊天通知之外",
  "Enable it in Settings, under the Troubleshooting section.\n\nThis widget is intended to help you understand how different configurations (e.g.: browser tabs, scripts, etc.) affect Torn PDA's memory usage.\n\nBe aware that memory usage information might not be accurate in some devices.": "在设置中, 麻烦排除栏下启用它。\n\n此部件旨在帮助您了解不同配置( 例如: 浏览器标签、 脚本等) 如何影响Torn PDA 的内存使用。\n\n请注意,某些装置的内存使用信息可能不准确。",
  "Enable it under the travel alert options. The notification will tell you which of the items you have restock alerts for are in stock in the country you are landing in.": "在旅行警报选项下启用它。 通知会告诉你哪些物品有补给警报 是在你降落的国家储存的",
  "Enabled by default (can be disabled in Settings > Time).\n\nTapping the clock will now display a toast notification when an event or competition is active, showing details and the remaining time until it ends.": "默认启用( 可以在设置 > 时间中禁用) 。\n\n当一个事件或竞赛在进行时, 点击时钟将显示敬酒通知, 显示细节及剩余时间, 直至结束。",
  "Enabled by default. See Settings / Advanced Browser Settings / Player Profiles\n\nIf enabled, this will show a notes widget in the profile page for those players that you have added notes to (as friends, stakeouts or targets)\n\nThe notes icon is actionable (tap to change notes)": "默认启用。 见设置/高级浏览器设置/播放器配置文件\n\n如果启用此选项, 这将在配置文件页面中显示您已经添加到注释的玩家( 作为朋友、 监视或目标) 的便记部件。\n\n注释图标是可操作的( 用于更改注释)",
  "Enhanced browser floating action button with additional customization options for buttons and actions": "增强的浏览器浮动动作按钮,并给按钮和动作增加定制选项",
  "Events: HTML tags no longer show up in the timeline text": "事件: HTML 标记不再出现在时间表文本中",
  "FFScouter Premium: stat distribution, travel timers and activity tracking": "FFSCUT Premium: 状态分布、旅行计时器和活动跟踪",
  "FFScouter is an external service that estimates battle scores for Torn players.\n\nTwo new options are available in Settings (Stats & Player Notes):\n\n1. Prefer FFScouter battle score: replaces the vague estimated stats range (e.g. '2M - 25M') with FFScouter's battle score estimate on war cards, retal cards and profile checks. Also used for sorting, filters and SmartScore calculations. Data is cached locally for 24 hours.\n\n2. Override old spies (1-12 months): when enabled, if a spy is older than the configured threshold, FFScouter's estimate will be shown instead. A clock icon indicates when this override is active.\n\nFFScouter data is also available in the Faction Assistance dialog, so faction members can receive battle score and fair fight estimates in assist notifications.\n\nAn FFScouter section with detailed tips has been added to the Tips page.\n\nYou need an FFScouter API key (free at ffscouter.com) to use these features. Set it up in Chaining > FFScouter tab > API Key.": "FFScuter是一家外部服务公司 估计Torn球员的战绩得分\n\n在设置( Stats & Player Notes) 中有两个新选项:\n\n1. 选择FFScuter战役分数:用FFScuter的战役分数估计数(例如“2M - 25M”)取代模糊的估计统计范围(例如“2M - 25M”),而用FFScuter的战役分数估计数来计算战卡、 retal卡和剖面检查。 也用于分类、过滤和智能核心计算。 数据在当地储存24小时。\n\n2. 覆盖旧的间谍(1-12个月):一旦启用,如果间谍的年龄大于设定的门槛值,FFScuter的估计将会被显示。 时钟图标表示此覆盖激活的时间。\n\n派别援助对话中也提供FFScuter数据,这样派系成员可以获得战斗分数和公平战斗估计值,以协助通知。\n\n提示页面中添加了含有详细提示的FFScuter部分。\n\n您需要 FFScuter API 密钥( 在 ffscouter. com 免费) 才能使用这些特性。 在锁链 > FFScuter 标签 > API 密钥中设置它。",
